# Xcode / CocoaPods artefacts live under polderland-phaser/ios/.gitignore,
# which Capacitor generated; nothing extra is needed here.
#
# Note: this file used to carry a blanket `*.png` rule left over from the
# project's Flutter days. That silently kept the app icon and the store
# screenshots out of the repository, which would have broken any build that
# checks out the tree rather than using the working directory.

# Store metadata, privacy pages and helper tools are kept locally, not in git.
docs/
tools/
polderland-phaser/store/
.claude/launch.json
menu-screenshot.png
/.claude
